{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39906","headline":"追和白舍人咏白牡丹 · 徐夤","name":"追和白舍人咏白牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蓓蕾抽开素练囊，琼葩薰出白龙香。\n裁分楚女朝云片，翦破姮娥夜月光。\n雪句岂须徴柳絮，粉腮应恨帖梅妆。\n槛边几笑东篱菊，冷折金风待降霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39906.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39906","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}